<title>USA: G&amp;L reports fourth quarter rise in FFO.</title>
<headline>G&amp;L reports fourth quarter rise in FFO.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>G&amp;L Realty Corp said funds from operations per share for the fourth quarter increased to $0.45 compared to $0.44 for the same period in 1995.</p>
</text>
